DTSTAMP:20260802T000000Z
DTSTART:20260926T060000Z
DTEND:20260926T100000Z
SUMMARY:Crested Butte Ultra
DESCRIPTION:Hosted during the peak of autumn\, this trail race treats runners to golden aspen groves and expansive mountain vistas. The course uses flowy singletrack and challenging terrain around one of Colorado's most famous mountain towns.
LOCATION:Crested Butte Mountain Resort\, 12 Emmons Rd\, Crested Butte\, CO 81225
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
