UID:the-bear-chase-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260802T000000Z
DTSTART:20261003T053000Z
DTEND:20261003T093000Z
SUMMARY:The Bear Chase
DESCRIPTION:The Bear Chase Race Endurance Festival is a multi-distance trail running event featuring 100K\, 50 Mile\, 50K\, Half Marathon\, 10K and 5K distances at Bear Creek Lake Park in Lakewood\, CO. The course is relatively fast by trail/ultra standards with 99% soft surface single track dirt trail. An excellent race for first-time trail and ultramarathoners with challenging terrain and panoramic views. Races held October 3-4\, 2026 with 100K and 50 Mile on Saturday and Half Marathon\, 10K\, and 5K on Sunday.
LOCATION:Bear Creek Lake Park\, Big Soda Lake Beach\, 15600 W. Morrison Road\, Lakewood\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:windsor-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260802T000000Z
DTSTART:20261004T070000Z
DTEND:20261004T110000Z
SUMMARY:Windsor Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The Windsor Marathon events presented by Banner MD Anderson feature multiple distances for all ages. Starting and ending at The Island at Pelican Lakes in Water Valley\, with a great after party including food\, drinks\, music\, kids zone and more in Windsor\, Colorado. Race perks include finisher lunch\, beer and non-alcoholic beverages\, finisher shirts and medals\, prizes for top finishers\, and support for local nonprofits.
LOCATION:The Island at Pelican Lakes in Water Valley\, Windsor\, CO 80550
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
