UID:longmont-turkey-trot-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260802T000000Z
DTSTART:20261114T090000Z
DTEND:20261114T130000Z
SUMMARY:Longmont Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The Longmont Turkey Trot is one of the fastest\, most scenic 10K and 2-mile courses. Participants can run\, roll\, or compete in the wheelchair division for the 10K race to kick off the holiday season.
LOCATION:Altona Middle School\, Longmont\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
