BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pumpkin-pie-5k10k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260802T000000Z
DTSTART:20261121T090000Z
DTEND:20261121T130000Z
SUMMARY:Pumpkin Pie 5K/10K
